# IceWarp 14.3 -> 14.4 upgrade benchmark

Generated: `{{ r.generated_at | default('n/a') }}` on `{{ r.host | default('n/a') }}`.

This report times the schema `ALTER`s IceWarp itself runs during the unattended
14.3 -> 14.4 upgrade. The statements are captured by MySQL's slow log
(`log_output=TABLE`, `log_slow_admin_statements=ON`, `long_query_time=0`) over
the capture window below; install wall-clock time is measured separately.

